A1. Keep this under your hat (pl.) ~ HEADS
A6. You'll always see these on horses. ~ MANES
A11. Shakespeare tossed off quite a lot of these. ~ SONNETS
A13. These are full of hot dogmas. ~ MODERNS
A15. The way of all flash. ~ MODE
A16. Not the least bit citified. ~ RURAL
