A32. A beastly pacifier. ~ TAMER
A34. This is bad stuff. ~ SIN
A35. A good thing to get settled on. ~ STOOL
A37. This is awfully colorful. ~ RED
A38. There is an interesting feminine movement here. ~ SAMOA
