A63. To work with your fingers. ~ KNEAD
A64. These come high on the ladies. ~ HOSE
A65. These are always hanging around Peggy Joyce. ~ ERMINES
A67. You've got to get sick before you can do this. ~ RECOVER
A69. This has no legs but runs. ~ SEDAN
A70. This is something about highstrung people (pl.) ~ ROPES

D1. Jonahs. ~ HOODOOS
D2. These are great stopping places. ~ ENDS
D3. A Scotch one. ~ ANE
D4. Prefix meaning down. ~ DE
D5. This is usually surrounded by a gay little band. ~ STRAW
